    "qualification_limitations": [
      "Real signed HTTPS/PostgreSQL component registration with actual full migration engine and least-privilege runtime; pinned sandbox-api execution, complete binary capture, EOF, process/API restart and genuine TCP lost-response observations.",
      "Early-ID negative uses real fsynced persistence callback before rejecting wrong actual candidate metadata; actual08 primary-ledger and cloud control-plane acceptance remain separate qualification requirements.",
      "Actual cloud create-or-get, quota/account limits, secret-bearing remote injection, persistent-volume allocation and native frontier runner interactions remain unqualified without approved real-provider campaigns.",
      "TCP lost acknowledgements prove actual ambiguity; production exactly-once instruction authority remains in authenticated08/12 ledgers, not caller advisory input.",
      "One shared capture deadline and combined request/context/invocation cancellation are tested with real timers; no local fixture can mark a provider sandbox READY.",
      "Versioned STREAM_DIGESTS_CANONICAL_JSON capture metadata declares existing provider hash framing; historical private receipt preimages remain unchanged. Central08 independently verifies the declared scheme; this task-component does not grant provider readiness."
    ]
  },
